<title>UK: SOCCER-BARRY TOWN WIN WELSH CUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BARRY TOWN WIN WELSH CUP.</headline>
<dateline>CARDIFF 1997-05-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barry Town beat Cwmbran 2-1 (halftime 1-0) in the final of the Welsh Cup on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Barry Town - Griffiths 7, 73</p>
<p>Watkins - 48</p>
<p>Attendance: 3,000</p>
